### Changed

- Integrate the M9 Frontend Redesign into `main` for the v1.9.0 release. ([#244](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/244))

### Added

- Add inline citation badges to sanitized assistant Markdown answers through `AssistantMarkdown.Render(markdown, citations)`. ([#245](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/245))
- Add a primary ticket action based on the first actionable `SuggestedNextSteps` item. ([#237](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/237))
- Add a `CommandPalette` available from every page with `Ctrl/Cmd+K`. ([#236](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/236))
- Apply ticket status changes optimistically on the board and detail view, with rollback when a change is rejected. ([#235](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/235))
- Replace ticket status and assignee dialogs with inline `MudMenu` controls. ([#234](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/234))
- Add inline citation badges to assistant answers using `AnswerCitationLayout`. ([#233](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/233))
- Add the active agent roster to the chat system prompt using `GetAgentsHandler`. ([#221](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/221))
- Force one `check_grounding` call through `tool_choice` after retrieval when no grounding check has run. ([#218](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/218))
- Centralize palette, spacing, radius, elevation, and semantic chip colors in `Theme/DesignTokens.cs`. ([#213](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/213))

### Fixed

- Fix board title clamping by placing the title link inside a `board-card__title-row` wrapper. ([#240](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/240))
- Fix the assistant composer layout by targeting its panel with `::deep .assistant-chat`. ([#239](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/239))
- Fix the ticket queue’s overlapping `Category` and `Due` headers by giving the `Category` column an explicit width. ([#238](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/238))
- Clarify the chat system prompt’s confirmation policy so it requires a successful tool result before claiming a write and avoids repeating confirmation for requested changes. ([#223](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/223))
- Render ticket summary timestamps in `Anthropic:UserTimeZone`. ([#222](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/222))
- Report technical `search_knowledge_base` failures with `IsError: true`. ([#220](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/220))
- Score grounding with `SemanticGroundingEvaluator` and fall back to `LexicalGroundingEvaluator` when embeddings are unavailable. ([#219](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/219))
